Create the basic Voidborn enemy called Voidling.

Gameplay role:

* common melee enemy;
* weak;
* appears in large groups;
* walks directly toward the tower.

Design:

* compact shadow creature viewed directly from above;
* dark rounded armored body;
* four short claw-like limbs arranged for clear radial movement;
* small violet glowing core at the center;
* subtle jagged silhouette;
* no visible face;
* no humanoid anatomy;
* no weapon;
* rotationally readable so the sprite can be rotated toward the tower in Godot;
* simple enough to display in large numbers.

The Voidling must feel hostile but visually subordinate to stronger enemies.

